    "function": "sequence",
    "source_turn_preview_server_only": "The first stage usually includes mining and refining materials. These activities require energy, water and infrastructure, and their impacts vary according to geography. To compare different batteries fairly, researchers define a functional unit, such as one unit of electricity delivered over the battery's working life. Comparing batteries merely by physical weight can be misleading when their capacities differ."
